        "TileImage": "$($repository 19dd4206-5386-4a88-9899-0e1bd46d2805).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rYou have been tasked with the elimination of Max Decker, the current head of the russian intelligence agency &apos;FSB&apos;. After having been paid by Viktor Novikov to destory all evidence against himself, Decker set a fire in the &apos;FSB&apos;-headquarters, leading to the destruction of various other high-value files. Because of this, the client, an opposing member of the &apos;FSB&apos;, ordered his termination.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
